    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMMER IN THE CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Summer Summerson, an eighteen year old girl from the middle of nowhere trying to achieve her dream of becoming a professional photographer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300400/extras/7d9b78b6fe35ae95b4a46099827b471e.avif?t=1754049087\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After participating and winning an online photography contest, Summer receives an offer for a scholarship at one of the most prestigious art colleges in the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in order to follow her dream she will have to leave her rural home and move into the big city, a new environment she never experienced before. Help Summer tackle that exciting new environment while meeting its quirky, sexy and kinky inhabitants.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Summer In The City&quot; is a wholesome, funny, sexy and kinky adult visual novel where choices matter. The characters create a sex positive environment around them, where consensual relationships, curiosity and self-determination are celebrated. The main protagonist Summer will have to deal with some typical coming-of-age drama every once in a while, but nothing of world ending proportions. The story is told via a slice-of-life narrative through a branching storyline. The game is mainly focused on female/female relationships, but there is limited bisexual content too, which is 100% optional.</p>",
